====================================================================================================
§6  COOLING, SYSTEM AND THE BOOKING FORK (in-model / arithmetic)
====================================================================================================
per-cell dissipation [E8]: 353 K 12.67 uW (the chain's stored value), 300 K 7.78-10.22 uW, <=150 K 0.972 uW (ratio to 300 K: 0.1250); uncertified below ~255 K (Part II section 1)
all-digital lane at 300 K: 41.5-57.6 mW
Carnot work per watt removed (300 K ambient): 77 K 2.896, 20 K 14.000, 4 K 74.000
wall-plug power relative to the warm all-digital lane (record-idiom cells):
   lane            equal dissipation, Carnot  Joule model, Carnot  Joule model: Carnot fraction needed
   TQ-4 (4 K)                          66.93                8.366                        beyond Carnot
   TQ-20 (20 K)                        13.65                1.706                        beyond Carnot
   TQ-77 (77 K)                         3.75                0.468                               39.6 %
   digital @77 K                        3.90                0.487                               41.4 %
(any cold win is a cooling win: the cold all-digital lane needs about the same cooler as the analog hybrid)
break-even cold-cell dissipation ratio r = P_cell(77 K)/P_cell(300 K) vs cooler efficiency (fraction of Carnot);
the Joule model [E8] predicts r = 0.125:
   TQ-77         : 100 % -> r <= 0.2668, 40 % -> r <= 0.1262, 30 % -> r <= 0.0976, 20 % -> r <= 0.0672, 10 % -> r <= 0.0347
   digital @77 K : 100 % -> r <= 0.2567, 40 % -> r <= 0.1214, 30 % -> r <= 0.0939, 20 % -> r <= 0.0646, 10 % -> r <= 0.0334

system (external workload inputs): 25,598,361,600 ternary MACs/token, 5.669 GB/token streamed; one lane = 86.26 tok/s at 69 GHz
   0.5 TB/s ->   88.2 tok/s (memory-bound) -> 2 lanes; operand launch 44.2 Tb/s (320 lines/lane; no on-fabric storage)
   1.0 TB/s ->  176.4 tok/s (memory-bound) -> 3 lanes; operand launch 66.2 Tb/s (320 lines/lane; no on-fabric storage)
   3.0 TB/s ->  529.2 tok/s (memory-bound) -> 7 lanes; operand launch 154.6 Tb/s (320 lines/lane; no on-fabric storage)
   lane cells at 300 K, full utilisation: 0.48 mJ/token; in-fabric photons at 2600 quanta, 10 bits/MAC, 50 % ones: 0.220 uJ/token

